# Supabase "dashboard" project — the reverse-ETL target holding the Gold-layer
# aggregates (claims_summary, claims_by_type, claims_by_geography,
# claims_lifecycle). This is NOT the source claims project.
#
# Copy to .env and fill in from: Supabase → Project Settings → API.
# Both values are exposed in the client bundle by design: the anon key is
# read-only here, because the dashboard project's RLS policies grant anonymous
# SELECT and nothing else. Never put the service_role key or the database
# password in this file.
#
# Leave these unset and the dashboard renders its bundled sample snapshot
# instead, clearly badged as sample data.

VITE_SUPABASE_DASHBOARD_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_DASHBOARD_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
